	(text "R_{NTC} = 114.14 kOhms @ 22C\nR_{NTC} = 5.69 kOhms @ 105C\nV_{ADC} = 3.3 * (R_NTC / (R_FIXED + R_NTC))\n\nWith R_{FIXED} = 10 kOhms:\nat 22C: V_{ADC} = 3.03V\nat 105C: V_{ADC} = 1.20V"
